1
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:06,629
dbt can build a model as a view or as a table.

2
00:00:06,909 --> 00:00:11,932
A view stores only the query, so it is always fresh, but every read runs it again.

3
00:00:12,212 --> 00:00:16,430
A table stores the rows: fast to read, and as fresh as the last run.

4
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:19,669
Right now every model is a view, the default.

5
00:00:19,949 --> 00:00:26,433
We keep trips a view, a thin layer over the files, and make the three marts tables, because people query those.

6
00:00:26,713 --> 00:00:29,195
Incremental and ephemeral models come later.

7
00:00:30,145 --> 00:00:33,925
Open the project, and open dbt project dot yml.

8
00:00:35,888 --> 00:00:39,343
Under nyc taxi, add plus materialized, table.

9
00:00:39,623 --> 00:00:41,935
Every model in the project becomes a table.

10
00:00:42,215 --> 00:00:42,815
Save.

11
00:00:43,765 --> 00:00:45,079
But trips should stay a view.

12
00:00:45,359 --> 00:00:46,995
Open trips dot sql.

13
00:00:47,275 --> 00:00:51,308
At the very top, add a config block: materialized equals view.

14
00:00:51,588 --> 00:00:54,282
A setting in the model wins over the project file.

15
00:00:54,562 --> 00:00:55,162
Save.

16
00:00:56,112 --> 00:00:58,424
Run the project: Project menu, Run.

17
00:00:59,374 --> 00:01:04,651
The log now says sql view model for trips, and sql table model for the other three.

18
00:01:05,601 --> 00:01:07,112
Let's check in DuckDB.

19
00:01:07,392 --> 00:01:13,634
Open the SQL Editor, pick nyc taxi dev, and list the tables in the main schema, with their type.

20
00:01:17,886 --> 00:01:18,457
Run it.

21
00:01:22,065 --> 00:01:23,033
Trips is a view.

22
00:01:23,313 --> 00:01:26,161
The three marts are base tables, and so is the seed.

23
00:01:27,111 --> 00:01:30,591
Back in the project, the Git tab shows the two changed files.

24
00:01:32,845 --> 00:01:37,354
Stage all, type a message, materialize the marts as tables, and commit.

25
00:01:42,016 --> 00:01:44,051
Sync Changes, and it's on GitHub.

26
00:01:47,116 --> 00:01:50,407
To recap: views store the query, tables store the rows.

27
00:01:50,687 --> 00:01:57,373
One line in dbt project dot yml sets the default, and a config block in a model overrides it.

28
00:01:57,653 --> 00:01:58,984
Next, we test the data.
